# Windows-da CRLF, Linux/macOS-da LF. Checkout'da `core.autocrlf`
# sozlamasiga bog'liq bo'lib qolmasligi uchun `.gitattributes` bilan
# bir xil qilib belgilaymiz — aks holda har bir `git add`da ogohlantirish
# chiqadi va chalkash diff'lar paydo bo'ladi.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Windows skriptlari — cmd.exe LFni ko'rib chiqmaydi
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# Binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary